# AB-014: Similar initial pH can conceal very different acid reserves
# Candidate experiment; expected observations are not measured results.
register lv3
add v1 water 100mL
add v1 HCl 0.00001mol
measure v1 ph
new
add v2 water 100mL
add v2 CH3COOH 0.000066mol
measure v2 ph
add v1 NaOH 0.00002mol
add v2 NaOH 0.00002mol
measure v1 ph
measure v2 ph
inspect
